WEBVTT

00:00:09.090 --> 00:00:10.790
"It's your mother. Don't forget to say hi to your landlord!"

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:12.290
I forgot.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:20.960
How dirty.

00:00:25.130 --> 00:00:26.900
W-what are you doing?

00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:30.250
I had trouble sleeping on your sofa.

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:33.830
Please put on some clothes before Misao gets up.

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:35.270
Why?

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:37.730
Misao! This isn't what it looks like.

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:39.600
We were just sleeping together.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:41.310
Don't say that!

00:00:41.930 --> 00:00:43.310
How nice for you.

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:45.720
Getting to sleep with such a beautiful woman.

00:00:46.570 --> 00:00:47.900
Why are you looking at me like that?

00:00:48.070 --> 00:00:49.640
You think something happened, don't you?

00:00:49.850 --> 00:00:51.010
Like what?

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:53.230
You know...

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:54.800
Hey.

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:56.300
Where's my coffee?

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:19.550
<i>Asura Cryin'</i>

00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:37.200
"Destruction of the future"

00:02:45.670 --> 00:02:47.510
What, I can't drink coffee?

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:50.350
It's written all over your face.

00:02:50.660 --> 00:02:52.290
Oh, no...

00:02:53.630 --> 00:02:55.500
I'm a flesh and blood human.

00:02:55.740 --> 00:02:58.480
Well, some things have been made more convenient...

00:02:58.850 --> 00:03:00.480
...thanks to the Dark Society.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:03.020
Dark... Society?

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:05.020
Would you like to touch them?

00:03:07.010 --> 00:03:09.030
See? Aren't they soft?

00:03:10.360 --> 00:03:12.540
This world was destroyed once.

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:18.180
Good morning.

00:03:18.180 --> 00:03:19.510
Your door was unlocked so I...

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:24.630
W-wait a second, An!

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:30.030
What happened? A gas explosion?

00:03:30.370 --> 00:03:32.250
Yeah, something like that.

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:35.590
About just now...

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:38.530
She's really taken a liking to you.

00:03:38.770 --> 00:03:39.420
No...

00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:40.780
Don't worry.

00:03:41.190 --> 00:03:42.590
I won't tell Higuchi.

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:45.020
Nevermind that. We've got morning practice starting today.

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:46.070
Care to watch?

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:48.020
You've already joined.

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:50.020
I had already made up my mind.

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:52.490
You're more than welcome to watch us practice.

00:03:54.470 --> 00:03:55.770
I'll pass for now.

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:57.480
I see.

00:03:58.030 --> 00:03:58.740
Bye.

00:03:59.730 --> 00:04:02.190
Sorry. You even came all the way out here...

00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:05.090
Don't worry about it.

00:04:06.900 --> 00:04:08.240
I remember now, Misao.

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:09.090
Remember what?

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:11.580
Royal Dark Society.

00:04:12.130 --> 00:04:14.790
My brother received a scholarship from them.

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:16.980
No way! What kind of organization is it?

00:04:17.350 --> 00:04:19.570
I'm not sure.

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:21.180
Come on.

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:22.510
Tomoharu.

00:04:22.510 --> 00:04:24.420
More coffee.

00:04:24.420 --> 00:04:25.990
Why don't you ask her?

00:04:26.810 --> 00:04:28.890
This world was destroyed once.

00:04:30.020 --> 00:04:32.580
Can't she leave me alone?

00:04:35.590 --> 00:04:40.260
Now that he's a handler, we can't let Tomoharu Natsume run loose.

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:42.960
I will continue watching him.

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:46.000
Don't let Kanade Takatsuki near him.

00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:51.090
The reason demons possess unparalleled beauty...

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:52.660
...is extremely clear.

00:04:56.550 --> 00:04:57.370
Takatsuki.

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:01.430
Good morning.

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:02.900
Good morning.

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:14.170
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:16.120
Oh, no...

00:05:19.770 --> 00:05:21.140
Okay then.

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:26.120
Next, open your textbooks to page 35.

00:05:26.120 --> 00:05:28.790
Maybe it is just a coincidence.

00:05:29.130 --> 00:05:30.390
She is pretty cute.

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:32.030
That's not what I meant.

00:05:32.200 --> 00:05:34.490
She doesn't seem the type to break into someone's house.

00:05:34.860 --> 00:05:37.150
No, those breasts are unnatural.

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:38.520
What are you talking about?

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:40.520
She's definitely stuffing them.

00:05:42.990 --> 00:05:46.100
I wasn't expecting Reishiro to be so forward...

00:05:46.540 --> 00:05:48.110
...but it's not anything worth noting.

00:05:48.690 --> 00:05:51.120
If you're in control of the situation it's fine...

00:05:51.770 --> 00:05:54.290
...but they know the two of them have been in contact.

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:57.710
They'll come at us aggressively now.

00:05:58.630 --> 00:06:01.360
The Dark Society cannot intervene at this time.

00:06:02.450 --> 00:06:03.440
Don't forget.

00:06:06.450 --> 00:06:07.610
What are you going to do, Tomo?

00:06:08.740 --> 00:06:09.420
Practice.

00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:10.750
Will you come watch?

00:06:10.990 --> 00:06:11.640
Oh.

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:14.680
That's right, Tomo. Join the track team.

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:17.580
Leave Shuri Kurosaki to me.

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:19.490
Good plan.

00:06:19.970 --> 00:06:21.100
Sorry.

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:23.590
I need to go see my landlord.

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:24.780
Oh, okay.

00:06:25.880 --> 00:06:26.780
Sorry.

00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:30.110
Our landlord's house is crazy.

00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:32.100
"Shioizumi"

00:06:30.730 --> 00:06:33.010
I'm pretty sure he doesn't need our rent.

00:06:33.460 --> 00:06:35.640
He has money because he collects it.

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:48.000
That's the main house.

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:50.460
But my grandfather doesn't live over there.

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:52.030
Really?

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:55.040
You really are just like your brother.

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:56.100
You know him?

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:58.280
Well, I am the landlord's granddaughter.

00:06:58.380 --> 00:07:00.020
Of course.

00:07:01.010 --> 00:07:03.200
Sorry. We'll have to walk from here.

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:07.570
My grandfather hardly sees anyone.

00:07:08.010 --> 00:07:11.670
He won't eat unless either Kana or I take it to him.

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:16.410
But he's really looking forward to seeing you.

00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:17.950
Strange, isn't it?

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:22.010
Is this where he lives?

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:23.790
Weird, huh?

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:25.530
Please come in.

00:07:26.450 --> 00:07:27.530
Excuse me.

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:39.220
Greet him.

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:41.000
Uh, nice to...

00:07:41.000 --> 00:07:43.250
Don't you think it's beautiful?

00:07:45.230 --> 00:07:49.020
The spiral is the foundation of our world.

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:52.130
Weather, life, stars...

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:55.440
The principles of all things are found in the spiral.

00:07:55.650 --> 00:07:58.720
There are even those that claim space...

00:07:58.720 --> 00:08:02.580
...is the remnant of a spiral turning at the speed of light.

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:06.540
What do you think?

00:08:07.020 --> 00:08:09.000
Spirals?

00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:13.030
It is said the reason the world is made not of straight lines but spirals...

00:08:13.230 --> 00:08:17.940
...is that spirals are more efficient.

00:08:18.730 --> 00:08:22.890
But if space itself truly is made of spirals...

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:25.010
...it is only a natural conclusion.

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:28.260
And if space is made of spirals...

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:31.640
...then time must be as well.

00:08:33.550 --> 00:08:36.350
Is this a new performance...

00:08:36.350 --> 00:08:38.530
...or have we returned to the past?

00:08:38.530 --> 00:08:41.230
Tomo, do what you came here to do so we can leave.

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:45.230
Um, about the Meiotei I'm renting...

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:48.850
I'm sorry! I'll fix it right away!

00:08:49.190 --> 00:08:53.830
Very soon you will be confronted with a particular choice.

00:08:58.370 --> 00:09:03.020
I hope you are able to choose what is best for yourself.

00:09:05.610 --> 00:09:08.000
What a strange old man.

00:09:09.910 --> 00:09:11.310
I wonder...

00:09:13.870 --> 00:09:15.550
Do you remember the way back?

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:17.320
Choose wisely.

00:09:20.870 --> 00:09:22.790
Why don't you take a look from above?

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:25.790
Oh, come on.

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:26.510
Please.

00:09:28.520 --> 00:09:29.680
Don't look.

00:09:35.830 --> 00:09:36.790
Takatsuki?

00:09:38.770 --> 00:09:39.590
She ran.

00:09:39.590 --> 00:09:40.170
Takatsuki!

00:09:40.780 --> 00:09:42.630
Wait! Why are you running?

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:44.470
Takatsuki, wait!

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:04.170
They're big, aren't they?

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:07.520
I knew you were looking.

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:11.170
There. You're fine.

00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:13.190
Oh, yeah. Thanks.

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:16.600
So close...

00:10:17.110 --> 00:10:18.240
S-s-sorry!

00:10:19.370 --> 00:10:20.240
W-what?

00:10:20.660 --> 00:10:21.550
Your seat cushion!

00:10:21.890 --> 00:10:24.180
It's fine. You don't need to...

00:10:37.870 --> 00:10:38.390
Co...

00:10:39.480 --> 00:10:40.710
Cosplay.

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:55.660
So it was you after all.

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:58.160
Can you explain to me what's going on?

00:10:58.740 --> 00:11:01.020
It's not good...

00:11:01.300 --> 00:11:03.310
...to raid.

00:11:03.690 --> 00:11:04.640
So...

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:15.810
Do you think...?

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:17.550
Is that all?

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:19.120
She doesn't say much.

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:20.380
Come on, now.

00:11:20.970 --> 00:11:24.070
Oh, do you have a projection body?

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:26.260
You can't see her?

00:11:26.530 --> 00:11:30.180
While I'm camouflaged, it's a little...

00:11:30.490 --> 00:11:31.380
Camouflage?

00:11:31.720 --> 00:11:33.090
How should I know?

00:11:33.430 --> 00:11:35.440
You're called Misao?

00:11:35.680 --> 00:11:36.840
What a pretty name.

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:38.170
Th-thank you.

00:11:39.230 --> 00:11:42.070
Why do you keep calling Misao a projection body?

00:11:43.130 --> 00:11:45.960
Well, that's what she is.

00:11:45.960 --> 00:11:47.910
What is a projection body?

00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:53.470
It's... something like a living spirit.

00:11:53.750 --> 00:11:56.580
The sacrifice bound within the Asura Machina...

00:11:56.780 --> 00:11:57.640
Sacrifice?

00:11:59.210 --> 00:12:00.440
Human sacrifice.

00:12:02.010 --> 00:12:03.580
What's the Asura Machina?

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:06.380
Something unfortunate.

00:12:07.850 --> 00:12:11.090
Why do you know all this stuff?

00:12:11.260 --> 00:12:13.040
Because I am a demon.

00:12:14.640 --> 00:12:16.150
De-mon!

00:12:16.320 --> 00:12:19.350
I heard you. I was just wondering...

00:12:23.180 --> 00:12:24.000
What's going on?

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:32.020
It's those guys from last night.

00:12:32.260 --> 00:12:33.420
They must have been watching us.

00:12:33.590 --> 00:12:34.720
Hide!

00:12:35.030 --> 00:12:35.710
We're coming in.

00:12:39.600 --> 00:12:41.040
Why you little...

00:12:49.640 --> 00:12:51.420
Go home, father.

00:12:51.720 --> 00:12:52.920
Father?

00:12:52.920 --> 00:12:54.290
Don't come here any more.

00:12:54.630 --> 00:12:56.030
Who is this kid?

00:12:56.510 --> 00:12:58.420
If you hurt Tomoharu again...

00:12:58.520 --> 00:12:59.540
Tomoharu?

00:12:59.850 --> 00:13:01.700
Nice to meet you, sir.

00:13:01.930 --> 00:13:03.640
Watch your tone!

00:13:03.780 --> 00:13:04.560
Go home!

00:13:07.120 --> 00:13:09.550
Sir. I will handle this.

00:13:15.900 --> 00:13:17.160
Go ahead.

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:20.650
Is this our last meal?

00:13:21.840 --> 00:13:24.030
Tomo, he's got a gun.

00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:28.770
It was nice meeting you last night.

00:13:28.770 --> 00:13:30.210
What a nice suit.

00:13:30.820 --> 00:13:32.600
W-where is the restroom?

00:13:33.520 --> 00:13:36.290
What do you think of Miss Kanade?

00:13:36.660 --> 00:13:37.690
So that's it.

00:13:39.020 --> 00:13:41.000
And our true identity?

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:44.140
She... mentioned demons.

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:48.750
The Takatsuki group controls nearly the entire city.

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:53.290
But Miss Takatsuki dislikes our business...

00:13:53.940 --> 00:13:58.040
...so she is living at Mr. Shioizumi's place by herself.

00:13:59.160 --> 00:14:01.010
Her feelings are understandable.

00:14:01.960 --> 00:14:04.420
Ostracized for being a member of the Takatsuki family...

00:14:04.970 --> 00:14:06.640
...she has been quite lonely.

00:14:07.430 --> 00:14:09.410
Are you taking advantage of that loneliness?

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:10.570
W-what?

00:14:10.570 --> 00:14:11.280
Mr. Natsume.

00:14:11.520 --> 00:14:14.050
I'd never do anything like that!

00:14:14.490 --> 00:14:16.000
I hate to do this, but...

00:14:19.550 --> 00:14:21.020
...you must die.

00:14:41.260 --> 00:14:42.050
Good morning.

00:14:48.470 --> 00:14:50.010
I hate to do this, but...

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:57.830
...could you give this to Miss Kanade?

00:14:58.370 --> 00:14:59.740
It's a high school entrance gift.

00:15:01.340 --> 00:15:03.390
I was surprised when I saw you.

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:09.200
Miss Kanade has never brought school friends home with her before.

00:15:09.950 --> 00:15:11.350
Well?

00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:13.840
Will you do this for us?

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:19.920
I think it's my fault your father didn't get to give it to you himself.

00:15:20.700 --> 00:15:21.690
I'm sorry.

00:15:22.380 --> 00:15:23.570
All I cause is trouble.

00:15:23.810 --> 00:15:24.630
Don't worry about it.

00:15:25.010 --> 00:15:27.770
You sneaked into my house that night...

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:30.880
...to do something about that trunk before a fight broke out, right?

00:15:32.550 --> 00:15:33.880
He's a good father.

00:15:37.470 --> 00:15:41.020
Don't think I've accepted that boy.

00:15:41.020 --> 00:15:42.760
Of course. He is only an errand boy.

00:15:43.140 --> 00:15:47.200
Miss Kanade would never return a gift to him.

00:15:47.540 --> 00:15:48.740
What are you trying to say?

00:15:49.250 --> 00:15:51.710
Mr. Natsume is not only a handler...

00:15:52.050 --> 00:15:54.680
...but also the brother of Naotaka Natsume.

00:15:55.870 --> 00:15:59.010
I don't care who he is. If he lays a single finger on my daughter...

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:02.020
...I'll kill him myself.

00:16:03.830 --> 00:16:04.920
Tomo!

00:16:05.330 --> 00:16:07.010
You've got practice, right? I'll watch.

00:16:07.380 --> 00:16:08.230
Great!

00:16:10.420 --> 00:16:12.020
A message from the student council.

00:16:12.640 --> 00:16:15.510
Class 1-7, Mr. Tomoharu Natsume.

00:16:15.920 --> 00:16:18.440
Please come to the First Student Council office immediately.

00:16:18.440 --> 00:16:20.290
I guess you won't be coming today either.

00:16:20.600 --> 00:16:21.480
Sorry.

00:16:22.780 --> 00:16:24.660
What did you do this time, Tomo?

00:16:25.200 --> 00:16:27.250
I don't remember doing anything.

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:30.840
Please come to the First Student Council office immediately.

00:16:31.210 --> 00:16:32.650
Worried about Natsume?

00:16:38.610 --> 00:16:40.540
"First Student Council Office"

00:16:42.240 --> 00:16:44.360
Uh, I'm Tomoharu Natsume from...

00:16:44.050 --> 00:16:45.490
Congratulations, Mr. Natsume.

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:48.940
Welcome to the First Student Council.

00:16:47.990 --> 00:16:51.670
"First Student Council President"

00:16:50.470 --> 00:16:51.090
Tomo!

00:16:51.220 --> 00:16:52.110
You!

00:16:52.110 --> 00:16:54.110
Allow me to introduce myself.

00:16:54.540 --> 00:16:57.200
I'm the First Student Council President Reishiro Saeki.

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:58.190
Student council president?

00:16:58.530 --> 00:17:00.750
Starting today, as a member of the First Student Council...

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:05.220
...in other words, the Holy Guard, you'll be working for us.

00:17:06.930 --> 00:17:08.600
Rejoice, Mr. Natsume.

00:17:09.050 --> 00:17:13.320
You have been chosen to be one of the faithful soldiers of God.

00:17:13.730 --> 00:17:16.560
To protect the balance of the universe...

00:17:16.560 --> 00:17:17.790
...fight with us.

00:17:19.670 --> 00:17:21.610
What do you think of Natsume?

00:17:22.160 --> 00:17:23.760
What do you mean?

00:17:24.140 --> 00:17:25.760
None of us know what will happen...

00:17:25.980 --> 00:17:28.550
...if the world's balance is broken.

00:17:29.670 --> 00:17:31.000
What's wrong, Mr. Natsume?

00:17:31.350 --> 00:17:32.640
Take my hand.

00:17:33.020 --> 00:17:34.860
This guy is dangerous.

00:17:35.170 --> 00:17:36.360
He's totally crazy.

00:17:36.600 --> 00:17:37.080
Yeah.

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:38.520
That's unfair.

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:41.010
You can see Misao, too?

00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:44.870
This is the only place for you.

00:17:45.240 --> 00:17:49.440
As a handler, it is your responsibility to eradicate all demons...

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:51.530
...and your calling as a human.

00:17:51.870 --> 00:17:54.220
Just like me.

00:17:55.660 --> 00:17:56.270
Tomo...

00:17:56.950 --> 00:17:58.270
Allow me to introduce her.

00:17:58.660 --> 00:18:00.030
Her name is Aine.

00:18:00.270 --> 00:18:02.620
She is my projection body.

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:06.990
There are others like Misao?

00:18:07.850 --> 00:18:10.000
Stay away from Natsume...

00:18:10.410 --> 00:18:11.910
...before it's too late.

00:18:12.010 --> 00:18:13.410
What are you talking about?

00:18:14.130 --> 00:18:18.600
My brother is captain of the Holy Guard, Reishiro Saeki.

00:18:20.380 --> 00:18:21.400
Tell me.

00:18:21.920 --> 00:18:23.280
What is a projection body?

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:25.190
I'll ask the questions.

00:18:25.430 --> 00:18:26.970
Just answer them.

00:18:28.200 --> 00:18:32.400
You'll pledge loyalty to the Holy Guard, won't you?

00:18:34.890 --> 00:18:35.880
I refuse.

00:18:36.390 --> 00:18:37.420
Let's go, Misao.

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:45.240
I'll call people.

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:50.290
My brother will stop at nothing to prevent the contract.

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:53.570
It was truly a monster.

00:18:53.670 --> 00:18:56.540
Such horrible power cannot exist.

00:18:56.950 --> 00:18:59.170
Your brother is a monster?

00:19:00.470 --> 00:19:02.210
An unstoppable monster.

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:03.980
Of course he isn't. How rude.

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:08.390
I'm saying my brother will stop at nothing to prevent the birth of this monster!

00:19:11.940 --> 00:19:13.100
Hello?

00:19:14.500 --> 00:19:16.240
You mean Tomoharu's contract with...

00:19:18.770 --> 00:19:19.350
Miss Takatsuki!

00:19:21.840 --> 00:19:23.170
Damn it!

00:19:24.030 --> 00:19:26.480
If you reject my offer...

00:19:27.300 --> 00:19:29.150
...you must be eliminated.

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:34.370
Interaction between handlers and demons can only bring misfortune.

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:37.100
No!

00:19:41.370 --> 00:19:42.810
That was a close one.

00:19:43.350 --> 00:19:46.530
It seems this demon will die in your place.

00:19:47.690 --> 00:19:49.160
Let Tomoharu go.

00:19:49.470 --> 00:19:50.280
Takatsuki!

00:19:50.830 --> 00:19:53.630
I wanted to avoid a confrontation with the Takatsuki group...

00:19:53.970 --> 00:19:55.710
...but if you insist...

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:56.500
Let him go.

00:19:57.180 --> 00:19:57.660
Now.

00:19:58.170 --> 00:20:00.020
Thanks to you, we will have justice.

00:20:03.020 --> 00:20:03.700
Takatsuki!

00:20:12.860 --> 00:20:13.610
Takatsuki.

00:20:14.730 --> 00:20:16.540
I'm sorry.

00:20:31.770 --> 00:20:32.660
Takatsuki.

00:20:33.920 --> 00:20:34.540
Aine!

00:20:35.220 --> 00:20:37.610
Sleeping in ice stiller than darkness...

00:20:37.610 --> 00:20:38.810
Run, Tomoharu.

00:20:39.180 --> 00:20:41.400
The shadow frozen in the sound of science...

00:20:51.030 --> 00:20:51.710
Takatsuki!

00:20:52.090 --> 00:20:54.030
Forget about that demon.

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:56.490
What did she do to you?

00:20:56.770 --> 00:20:59.160
Stand aside if you want to live.

00:21:01.340 --> 00:21:03.050
We need that trunk, Tomo.

00:21:07.110 --> 00:21:08.000
Go get it!

00:21:08.380 --> 00:21:09.020
Misao!

00:21:23.570 --> 00:21:24.830
W-what was that?

00:21:27.430 --> 00:21:28.250
Tomoharu.

00:21:29.070 --> 00:21:29.820
Run!

00:21:32.010 --> 00:21:32.890
Takatsuki.

00:21:33.780 --> 00:21:36.550
This world was destroyed once.

00:21:37.130 --> 00:21:38.290
Two years from now...

00:21:39.180 --> 00:21:40.780
...719 days later...

00:21:41.020 --> 00:21:41.800
...in the future.

00:21:42.420 --> 00:21:45.290
Are you saying demons and Asura Machina...

00:21:48.600 --> 00:21:50.000
...exist?

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:25.100
"Preview"

00:23:20.730 --> 00:23:21.680
I want to save it.

00:23:21.890 --> 00:23:23.010
Whatever I do?

00:23:23.220 --> 00:23:24.110
How?

00:23:24.410 --> 00:23:25.340
No matter what?

00:23:25.510 --> 00:23:26.560
I can only pray.

00:23:26.770 --> 00:23:27.320
No.

00:23:27.760 --> 00:23:28.820
Answer me.

00:23:29.020 --> 00:23:30.290
You're not worth it.

00:23:30.420 --> 00:23:31.380
Believe.

00:23:32.560 --> 00:23:34.990
"The Shadow of Science"
